    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56687" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερᾰμ-εία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the potter's craft</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				324e
			</span></i>: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν πίθῳ τὴν κ.
			μανθάνειν</span>, of those who undertake the most difficult
			tasks without learning the elements of the art, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				514e
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>La.</u>
				187b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dicaearch.
			</span></i> Hist.<i><span class="en">
				51
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς αὐτῆς κ.</span>, of the
			same <i>make</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eratosth.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				11.482b
			</span></i>.</div>
